OL,3,AOslo mayor calls off wedding ceremony
OL,4,Aafter death of Norway's king
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarald reigned for 35 years and died at
OL,7,Fthe national hospital in Norway's
OL,8,Fcapital, where he was being treated for
OL,9,Fa rare blood condition. His son, King
OL,10,FHaakon VIII, ascended the throne on
OL,11,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
